Hello World!
 
About This Project
This is a sample project used to demonstrate collaborative development with Git and GitHub.

 Features
- Simple and beginner-friendly repository.
- Demonstrates the fork-and-pull request workflow.
- Shows how contributors can suggest improvements.

 Contributor
Brasilla-R

Purpose
To learn how to fork a repository, create a branch, make changes, and submit a pull request.

Future Improvements
The project can be improved by adding more examples and documentation for beginners.
